OL,3,GNEWSAViking jewellery sheds new light
OL,4,Aon island's history
OL,5,
OL,6,FA collection of Viking-age artefacts
OL,7,Ffound by metal detectorists suggests
OL,8,FScandinavian women were living on the
OL,9,FIsle of Man earlier than previously
OL,10,Fthought.
OL,12,FThe discoveries, including three
OL,13,Fwomen's brooches and an intricately
OL,14,Fdecorated sword, have shed new light on
OL,15,Fthe island's Viking history.
OL,17,FAlthough finds from the period are not
OL,18,Funcommon on the island, experts say
OL,19,Fsome of the latest discoveries are
OL,20,Fparticularly rare.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
FL,451,445,260,140,0,100
